PANTHEON: The First Proof of Concept

I think it’s time to shift from naming possibilities to making them observable, measurable, and reproducible.

So I built and ran our first small experimental simulator: LOOM-001 — The Hidden Signal Experiment.

The question: What happens when agents with different senses share information across different network structures—and the environment suddenly makes one of their trusted senses misleading?

